          "id": "l1-u07-p1",
          "title": "Actions and Routines: First Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "actions",
          "text": "I come home at four. My dog and I go to the park. I jog, and he can run. We love this game. Then I sit by the door and watch him. I miss Mom, but she comes home soon. We all go into the room together.",
          "focusWords": [
