          "title": "Everyday English: Second Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Today I walk to school with Mom. The new guard has a big job. He stands here by the red door and helps us. A boy has a bad fall, but he is okay. The guard is nice to him. \"No running,\" he says. We walk into school.",
